    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89364.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "It is really important to preside, to decide what you're going to take up and who you're going to recognize. This power was just so proud because we're not only women to have a seat at the table, we want them to have a seat at the head of the table.",
