      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership involves deciding which issues to address and whom to acknowledge.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Women should occupy positions of primary leadership, not just representation.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker feels pride in being recognized as a woman in a leadership position.",
