    "turn_text": "Today's summit, honestly, here's a little bit to women rule, is about examining how there are more women in power than ever before, but also looking at how more changes still need to come. My colleagues recently wrote a story, Sarah Ferris and John Bresnahan, that you have a record number of women in the Democratic Caucus as chairman of committees. In fact, seven full committees are chaired by women",
