    "turn_text": "break. Women account for half of the American workforce, yet still represent less than one-third of manufacturing workers. It's time for that to change. The National Association of Manufacturers, Workforce and Education Partner, the Manufacturing Institute, is committed to closing the gender gap in the industry. The Institute's STEP Women's Initiative empowers and inspires women every day. It creates support networks for women in the industry and encourages them to pay it forward by mentoring the next generation. To learn more about the Manufacturing Institute's Workforce and Education programs, as well as the NAM's Creators Wanted Fund, a multi-million dollar campaign to inspire and drive more Americans to pursue careers in modern manufacturing, please visit NAM.org.",
